I go into the living room.
The room is very nice and bright.
A table stands by the window.
That is my desk.
I open my backpack.
My laptop is in the backpack.
I take the laptop.
Now the laptop stands on the table.
I also have books for work.
The books lie next to the laptop.
A notebook also lies on the table.
My pen lies next to the notebook.
A small wastebasket stands under the table.
A calendar hangs next to the window.
My backpack now lies on the floor.
The workspace is ready.
I like working here.
